{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 6003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is one simple question, only a few\nwords long, that can stop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6003,
    "dDurationMs": 5142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a thief from emptying your bank account,\neven when the voice on the phone sounds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11145,
    "dDurationMs": 1941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exactly like someone you love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18128,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is not an exaggeration, and I am\ngoing to prove it to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23091,
    "dDurationMs": 4642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right now, criminals are using a\nfrightening new kind of technology to copy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27733,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the voice of your own child, your\ngrandchild, and even the voice of your bank,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32775,
    "dDurationMs": 4842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they are using that stolen voice to\ntalk careful older people into handing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37617,
    "dDurationMs": 1681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over everything they have saved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40298,
    "dDurationMs": 3282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It works because it does not feel like a\nscam at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44120,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like family in trouble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46481,
    "dDurationMs": 3182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like your own bank calling to\nprotect you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50063,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is a single verification step,\none you can set up today in about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54685,
    "dDurationMs": 3382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five minutes, that shuts the whole thing\ndown cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59247,
    "dDurationMs": 4522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me walk you through exactly how\nthis scam drains a bank account, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63769,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I am going to hand you the one\nquestion, and the one calm habit, that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68231,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stop it every single time. Let me show you\nhow it happens, because once you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73394,
    "dDurationMs": 3261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "truly see it, you can never be fooled by\nit again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77495,
    "dDurationMs": 4963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These criminals now have tools that can\ncopy the voice of a real person from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82458,
    "dDurationMs": 3501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only a few seconds of sound. That is all\nit takes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85959,
    "dDurationMs": 3582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A short video your grandchild posted\nonline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90061,
    "dDurationMs": 3382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An old voice message. A clip from a\nbirthday party."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94003,
    "dDurationMs": 4342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From as little as three seconds of\ntalking, the machine builds a copy of that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98345,
    "dDurationMs": 5262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "voice so real that it can be made to say\nanything at all, in the exact tone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103607,
    "dDurationMs": 1561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the person you love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105988,
    "dDurationMs": 2862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, one evening, the phone rings in your\nkitchen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109150,
    "dDurationMs": 3021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is late, and the voice on the other end\nis crying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112612,
    "dDurationMs": 4862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is your grandson, and he says he has\nbeen in a car accident, or that he"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117474,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been arrested, and he is terrified,\nand he needs money right now, tonight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122996,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or something terrible is going to happen\nto him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125818,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it sounds just like him. Because in a\ncruel way, it is him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130980,
    "dDurationMs": 2841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is his own voice, stolen and copied."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134522,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your heart drops through the floor, and\nevery part of you wants to help him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138683,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that flood of panic is the exact thing\nthese thieves are counting on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142925,
    "dDurationMs": 3682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the coldest part of how the trick\nis built."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147127,
    "dDurationMs": 4502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every single piece of it is designed to\nstop you from thinking clearly, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151629,
    "dDurationMs": 1301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to stop you from checking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153870,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The caller will tell you there is no time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156432,
    "dDurationMs": 2141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They will beg you not to hang up the\nphone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159613,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes a second voice comes on the\nline, pretending to be a lawyer, or a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164335,
    "dDurationMs": 3522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "police officer, adding weight and fear to\nthe whole story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168657,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They will tell you not to tell anyone else\nin the family, because it is embarrassing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172879,
    "dDurationMs": 3482,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or because talking about it will somehow\nmake the trouble worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177981,
    "dDurationMs": 6183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then they will push you, gently at\nfirst and then harder, toward the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184825,
    "dDurationMs": 4342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They may ask you to wire it. They may tell\nyou to drive to the bank and take"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189167,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out cash while they stay on the phone in\nyour ear the entire time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193789,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They may even send someone to your front\ndoor to collect it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197690,
    "dDurationMs": 2462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Notice what every one of those has in\ncommon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200672,
    "dDurationMs": 4102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each one is a way to move the money out of\nyour bank account and into their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204774,
    "dDurationMs": 5182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hands, fast, before a single person who\nloves you has the chance to stop it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211037,
    "dDurationMs": 4322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is a second version of this same\ntrick that aims even more directly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215359,
    "dDurationMs": 3221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at your bank account, so you need to know\nthis one too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219100,
    "dDurationMs": 4102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this version, the phone rings and the\nvoice says it is calling from your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223202,
    "dDurationMs": 2001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "own bank, from the fraud department."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225643,
    "dDurationMs": 3502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They sound calm, and polite, and\ncompletely professional."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229545,
    "dDurationMs": 4302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They tell you there has been suspicious\nactivity on your account, that a criminal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233847,
    "dDurationMs": 2941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is trying to steal your money at this very\nmoment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236788,
    "dDurationMs": 1741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then comes the trap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239229,
    "dDurationMs": 4643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To keep your money safe, they say, you\nneed to move it right away into a new,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243872,
    "dDurationMs": 3061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "secure account that they will kindly help\nyou set up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247913,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like they are rescuing you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250475,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are doing the opposite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252776,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That new account belongs to them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255197,
    "dDurationMs": 4862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is the one fact that gives this\naway every time, so please hold on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260059,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to it tightly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261720,
    "dDurationMs": 4782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your real bank will never, ever call you\nand tell you to move your money into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266502,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a safe account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268343,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No true bank does this. No real government\nagent does this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273645,
    "dDurationMs": 4142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The very moment anyone tells you to move\nyour money in order to protect it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278067,
    "dDurationMs": 5283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are talking to a thief. That one\nsentence, remembered, will save some of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283350,
    "dDurationMs": 4442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you everything you own. So now, the part\nyou came here for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287792,
    "dDurationMs": 5202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The verification step that stops all of\nthis, no matter how perfect the fake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292994,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "voice sounds. It is simple, it is free,\nand you can do it this week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298977,
    "dDurationMs": 4702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sit down with your family, your children\nand your grandchildren, and together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303679,
    "dDurationMs": 3441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "choose a secret word. A family safe word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307621,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pick something that no stranger could ever\nguess, and that is written down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311843,
    "dDurationMs": 2421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nowhere online. Not a birthday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314764,
    "dDurationMs": 3662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not the name of a pet. Not a street you\nonce lived on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318786,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Choose something private, a little bit\nodd, and easy for your family to remember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324408,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe a silly word from an old family\njoke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327430,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you all agree to one firm rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330411,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If anyone ever calls in an emergency\nasking for money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335473,
    "dDurationMs": 5183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the very first thing you do, before\nanything else, is ask them for the safe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340656,
    "dDurationMs": 340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341756,
    "dDurationMs": 5003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the whole shield. A real\ngrandchild will know it in a heartbeat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347539,
    "dDurationMs": 4862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A copied voice, run by a criminal on the\nfar side of the world, cannot possibly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352401,
    "dDurationMs": 5763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know it, because that word lives only\ninside your family, and no machine can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358164,
    "dDurationMs": 2941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ever steal a word that was never spoken\nonline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362086,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the voice cannot give you the word, you\nhang up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365767,
    "dDurationMs": 4943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just like that, with nothing more than\none private word, you have defeated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370710,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a scam that has emptied the life savings\nof thousands of good people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376212,
    "dDurationMs": 4342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me show you just how simple that is in\nthe moment it matters most."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381274,
    "dDurationMs": 4502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Picture the phone ringing at eleven at\nnight, and the voice sobbing on the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385776,
    "dDurationMs": 3642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other end of the line is your\ngranddaughter, telling you she has been in a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389418,
    "dDurationMs": 3862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "terrible accident, that she is now in\ntrouble with the police, and that she"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393280,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "needs money wired to a lawyer before the\nmorning or she will be kept in a cell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398402,
    "dDurationMs": 4842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A year ago, a call like that might have\nfrozen your heart and made you forget"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403244,
    "dDurationMs": 2161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything you know in a single moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406006,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But not now, because now you have your\nword."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410248,
    "dDurationMs": 5002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So through all of that fear, you take one\nslow breath, and you say four calm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415250,
    "dDurationMs": 4522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "words. What is our safe word. And the line\ngoes quiet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420332,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The crying stops. The pleading stops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423574,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the machine on the other end does\nnot have your word, and it never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427536,
    "dDurationMs": 5722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will. In that sudden silence, you already\nknow the whole truth, and you gently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433258,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "set down the phone, and you call your\ngranddaughter directly, and she answers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437940,
    "dDurationMs": 3222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "half asleep in her own bed, completely\nfine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441842,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one small silence is the entire\ndifference between a family that loses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446504,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tens of thousands of dollars in a single\nterrible night, and a family that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451166,
    "dDurationMs": 5063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "loses nothing at all. And here is the calm\nhabit to pair with that word, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456229,
    "dDurationMs": 4082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one that covers every version of this,\nincluding a call that claims to be your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460311,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "own bank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461651,
    "dDurationMs": 4642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whenever a phone call brings sudden fear,\nand urgency, and a push toward your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466293,
    "dDurationMs": 3302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money, you hang up. You do not argue with\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469975,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not explain yourself. You simply\nhang up the phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473997,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you take one slow breath, and you\nreach out yourself, using a number that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478679,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you already know is real. Call your\ngrandchild back on the number you have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483221,
    "dDurationMs": 4442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "always had for them. Call your bank using\nthe number printed on the back of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487663,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your own card, or on your paper statement,\nand never a number that the caller"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491885,
    "dDurationMs": 5563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gives you. Nine times out of ten, your\ngrandchild will answer, safe and sound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497448,
    "dDurationMs": 4101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a little confused, and you will feel\nyour whole body finally relax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502190,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thief depends on you staying on their\nline, inside their panic, moving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506872,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at their speed. The instant you hang up\nand check for yourself, at your own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511674,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pace, their entire game collapses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514535,
    "dDurationMs": 5103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They simply cannot survive you taking five\nquiet minutes to make one honest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519638,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "phone call. There are a few smaller steps\nthat add another wall of protection,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524560,
    "dDurationMs": 2841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every one of them is worth your time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527801,
    "dDurationMs": 4262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Call your bank yourself, on a day when\nnothing is wrong, and ask them to add"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532063,
    "dDurationMs": 4743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what many of them call a trusted contact\nto your account, a person they are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536806,
    "dDurationMs": 3121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allowed to reach if they ever see\nsomething that looks strange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540547,
    "dDurationMs": 4042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ask them what alerts they can place on\nlarge withdrawals and transfers, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544589,
    "dDurationMs": 4002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that a big amount of money can never\nquietly slip out without you knowing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549331,
    "dDurationMs": 3882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Be a little more careful about how much of\nyour voice, and the voices of your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553213,
    "dDurationMs": 4742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grandchildren, sits out in the open on\nsocial media, because that is exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557955,
    "dDurationMs": 3082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the sound these thieves need to copy a\nvoice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561577,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most important of all, simply talk\nabout this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564738,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Call your children and your grandchildren\nthis week, and set up that safe word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569280,
    "dDurationMs": 1361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out loud, together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571461,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The families who beat this scam are almost\nalways just the ones who talked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575703,
    "dDurationMs": 1741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about it before the phone ever rang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578004,
    "dDurationMs": 4663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ones it destroys are nearly always the\nones who had never once heard that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582667,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such a thing was even possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584988,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is general information to help you\nprotect yourself and the people you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589189,
    "dDurationMs": 3182,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "love, and it is not legal or financial\nadvice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592871,
    "dDurationMs": 3942,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you believe you have already been\ntargeted, or you have lost money to a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596813,
    "dDurationMs": 4142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "call like this, you can report it to the\nauthorities, and there is a national"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600955,
    "dDurationMs": 5362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "elder fraud helpline, staffed by real\npeople, who can walk you through exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606317,
    "dDurationMs": 5463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what to do next. It is never too late to\nreach out and ask for help, and you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611780,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have absolutely nothing to be ashamed of,\nbecause these criminals fool careful,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617042,
    "dDurationMs": 3082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sharp, intelligent people every single day\nof the week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620124,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is what I want you to carry with\nyou after this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625186,
    "dDurationMs": 5022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The technology behind this scam is\nfrightening, and the honest truth is that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630208,
    "dDurationMs": 2782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is only going to get better at sounding\nreal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633350,
    "dDurationMs": 3001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the thing that beats it is not more\ntechnology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636951,
    "dDurationMs": 2541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is something no machine will ever have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639933,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the private trust between you and\nthe people you love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644035,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One secret word that lives only inside\nyour family."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647496,
    "dDurationMs": 4122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One calm habit of hanging up and checking\nfor yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652438,
    "dDurationMs": 5023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A stolen voice can cry, and beg, and sound\nexactly like your own grandchild"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657461,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the worst night of his life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659832,
    "dDurationMs": 4492,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it cannot know your word, and it\ncannot stop you from setting down the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664324,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "phone and calling the real one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667185,
    "dDurationMs": 3662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So set up your family safe word this week,\nbefore you need it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670847,
    "dDurationMs": 5382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you know someone, a friend, a\nneighbor, anyone at all who could be caught"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676229,
    "dDurationMs": 5163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off guard by a call like this, share this\nwith them today, because the people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681392,
    "dDurationMs": 3621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who hear about it in time are the ones who\nnever lose a thing."
    } ]
  } ]
}
